{
  "description": "Delegation tokens (RFC 8693 act chains). readDelegationTokenClaims checks signature-verified claims; delegationActor builds act from the chain (person's own delegate first). Signed cases use the deployment card signer (compact JWS, header {\"alg\",\"kid\",\"typ\":\"biam-delegation+jwt\"}, payload JSON.stringify(claims) in insertion order) and the @better-iam/a2a verifier.",
  "source": "packages/core/src/delegation-tokens.ts#readDelegationTokenClaims,delegationActor; packages/server/src/a2a.ts#cardSigner.signJwt,verifyJwt; packages/a2a/src/delegation-tokens.ts#verifyDelegationToken",
